"CBOR s neobaveznom Edge Impulse oznakom, dijeljenje na dijelove za duga "
"snimanja i Snimi sve; interval Channel Polling u postavkama protokola "
"(`5b4f31a6b3a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5b4f31a6b3a>`__, "
"`d1252a24f14 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d1252a24f14>`__, "
