"`d1c2ab02a5f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d1c2ab02a5f>`__, "
"`4808b8ffe26 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4808b8ffe26>`__, "
"`dfc323b4ec7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dfc323b4ec7>`__, "
"`61c077df9a5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/61c077df9a5>`__, "
