"**Birač izvora spremnika okvira i očitanje formata** -- odaberite senzor "
"koji struji na kamerama s više senzora, ili Isključeno; primljeni format "
"sličice prikazuje se u naslovu okna; prekidač JPG sada je birač JPG Mode / "
"RAW Mode (`e76284bde9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e76284bde9e>`__, `c2baff8d60c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c2baff8d60c>`__, `afece31cb6a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/afece31cb6a>`__, `76448d7b9dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/76448d7b9dd>`__)."

